Tailscale **__VERSION__** packaged for the **WD My Cloud EX2 Ultra** (OS 5, armhf).

### Install
1. Download `MyCloudEX2Ultra_tailscale___VERSION__.bin` below.
2. My Cloud dashboard → **Apps → Install an app manually** → choose the `.bin`.
3. Open **Apps → Tailscale**, paste an auth key, pick your toggles, click **Connect**.

Verify the download against `SHA256SUMS.txt`. See the [README](https://github.com/matanbaruch/tailscale-mycloud#readme) for usage and troubleshooting.

> Built and round-trip-verified in CI (APKG header, armhf `tailscaled`, expected files). On-device execution is your final test.
